	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Cherry MX style, Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, hot-swap socket, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R1.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile), User.3=13.95mm square with R1.00 corner relief (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square with R1.00 corner relief (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 2.00u vertical (1u wide x 2u tall, courtyard 19.00x38.05mm). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used. For Kailh Choc 1350 (V1) stabilizers use the _ChocV1Stab variant. For Kailh Choc V2 stabilizers use the _ChocV2Stab variant.")
	(tags "switch, low_profile, hot_swap")
